t:0;line-height:0;font-size:0">&nbsp;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 28px 4px" align="left"><span class="lk-badge" style="display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #cc9c42;border-radius:999px;background:#fbedcd;color:#633f0c;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128737;&#65039;</span> Security notice</span></td></tr><tr><td class="lk-body" dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:4px 28px 20px;font-family:'LXGW WenKai TC','PingFang SC','PingFang TC','Hiragino Sans','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','Noto Sans CJK SC','Noto Sans JP','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c1714"><div dir="ltr" lang="en"><p style="margin:0 0 16px">Your Lianki account was just signed in to from a browser it has not used before.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><th scope="row" align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">Time</th><td align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">November 9, 2026 at 6:07 PM (Japan Standard Time, GMT+9)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">Approximate location</th><td align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">Tokyo, Japan</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">Browser</th><td align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">Safari · iPhone</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px">If this was you, there is nothing to do.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px">If it was not you, sign in, remove any passkey you do not recognise on your profile page, and tell us at <a href="https://lianki.com/contact" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">https://lianki.com/contact</a>.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="lk-foot" dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:14px 28px 22px;border-top:1px solid #cc9c42;font-family:'LXGW WenKai TC','PingFang SC','PingFang TC','Hiragino Sans','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','Noto Sans CJK SC','Noto Sans JP','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d534a">Security notices like this one are on for your account. You can turn them off in <a href="https://lianki.com/my/preferences#mail" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">your preferences</a>, but we advise keeping them.<br><a href="https://lianki.com" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">lianki.com</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"`;

