:0">&nbsp;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 28px 4px" align="left"><span class="lk-badge" style="display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #cc9c42;border-radius:999px;background:#fbedcd;color:#633f0c;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128737;&#65039;</span> 安全提醒</span></td></tr><tr><td class="lk-body" dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:4px 28px 20px;font-family:'LXGW WenKai TC','PingFang SC','PingFang TC','Hiragino Sans','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','Noto Sans CJK SC','Noto Sans JP','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c1714"><div dir="ltr" lang="zh"><p style="margin:0 0 16px">你的炼記（Lianki）账号刚刚在一个以前未使用过的浏览器上登录。</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><th scope="row" align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">时间</th><td align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">November 9, 2026 at 6:07 PM (Japan Standard Time, GMT+9)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">大致位置</th><td align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">Tokyo, Japan</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">浏览器</th><td align="left" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">Safari · iPhone</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px">如果是你本人操作，无需处理。</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px">如果不是你本人，请登录后在个人资料页删除不认识的通行密钥，并通过 <a href="https://lianki.com/contact" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">https://lianki.com/contact</a> 联系我们。</p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="lk-foot" dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:14px 28px 22px;border-top:1px solid #cc9c42;font-family:'LXGW WenKai TC','PingFang SC','PingFang TC','Hiragino Sans','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','Noto Sans CJK SC','Noto Sans JP','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d534a">你的账号开启了这类安全提醒。你可以在<a href="https://lianki.com/my/preferences#mail" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">偏好设置</a>中关闭，但我们建议保持开启。<br><a href="https://lianki.com" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">lianki.com</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"`;

exports[`every template, every language, in the one layout the security notice's HTML (en, zh, ar) 3`] = `"<!doctype html><html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark"><title>تسجيل دخول جديد إلى حسابك في Lianki</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lxgw-wenkai-tc-web@1.522.0/lxgwwenkaitc-regular/result.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Yuji+Syuku&display=swap"><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}body{margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}a{color:#c8102e}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){.lk-page{background:#0e0a08!important}.lk-card{background:#1c1714!important}.lk-body,.lk-body p,.lk-body td,.lk-body th,.lk-body li,.lk-body b,.lk-body strong{color:#ece7dd!important}.lk-body .lk-muted,.lk-foot,.lk-foot td,.lk-foot p{color:#b9b0a3!important}.lk-body a,.lk-foot a,.lk-brand{color:#fb817f!important}.lk-body a.lk-btn{background:#c8102e!important;color:#fdfcf8!important}.lk-code{background:#2b2520!important;color:#ece7dd!important}.lk-badge{background:#332710!important;color:#f0d08f!important;border-color:#c29647!important}.lk-rule{border-color:#c29647!important}.lk-row{border-color:#c29647!important}}.lk-dark .lk-page{background:#0e0a08!important}.lk-dark .lk-card{background:#1c1714!important}.lk-dark .lk-body,.lk-dark .lk-body p,.lk-dark .lk-body td,.lk-dark .lk-body th,.lk-dark .lk-body li,.lk-dark .lk-body b,.lk-dark .lk-body strong{color:#ece7dd!important}.lk-dark .lk-body .lk-muted,.lk-dark .lk-foot,.lk-dark .lk-foot td,.lk-dark .lk-foot p{color:#b9b0a3!important}.lk-dark .lk-body a,.lk-dark .lk-foot a,.lk-dark .lk-brand{color:#fb817f!important}.lk-dark .lk-body a.lk-btn{background:#c8102e!important;color:#fdfcf8!important}.lk-dark .lk-code{background:#2b2520!important;color:#ece7dd!important}.lk-dark .lk-badge{background:#332710!important;color:#f0d08f!important;border-color:#c29647!important}.lk-dark .lk-rule{border-color:#c29647!important}.lk-dark .lk-row{border-color:#c29647!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-page{background:#0e0a08!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-card{background:#1c1714!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-body,[data-ogsc] .lk-body p,[data-ogsc] .lk-body td,[data-ogsc] .lk-body th,[data-ogsc] .lk-body li,[data-ogsc] .lk-body b,[data-ogsc] .lk-body strong{color:#ece7dd!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-body .lk-muted,[data-ogsc] .lk-foot,[data-ogsc] .lk-foot td,[data-ogsc] .lk-foot p{color:#b9b0a3!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-body a,[data-ogsc] .lk-foot a,[data-ogsc] .lk-brand{color:#fb817f!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-body a.lk-btn{background:#c8102e!important;color:#fdfcf8!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-code{background:#2b2520!important;color:#ece7dd!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-badge{background:#332710!important;color:#f0d08f!important;border-color:#c29647!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-rule{border-color:#c29647!important}[data-ogsc] .lk-row{border-color:#c29647!important}</style></head><body class="lk-page" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5eee1"><table role="presentation" class="lk-page" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f5eee1" style="background:#f5eee1"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px"><table role="presentation" class="lk-card" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#fefcf7" style="max-width:560px;background:#fefcf7;border-top:4px solid #c8102e;border-radius:4px"><tr><td dir="rtl" align="right" style="padding:22px 28px 10px"><a href="https://lianki.com" class="lk-brand" style="font-family:'Yuji Syuku','LXGW WenKai TC','Hiragino Mincho ProN','Songti SC','Noto Serif CJK SC','Noto Serif JP',Georgia,serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;color:#c8102e;text-decoration:none">Lianki</a></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 28px 14px"><div class="lk-rule" style="border-top:1px solid #cc9c42;height:0;line-height:0;font-size:0">&nbsp;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 28px 4px" align="right"><span class="lk-badge" style="display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #cc9c42;border-radius:999px;background:#fbedcd;color:#633f0c;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128737;&#65039;</span> إشعار أمني</span></td></tr><tr><td class="lk-body" dir="rtl" align="right" style="padding:4px 28px 20px;font-family:'LXGW WenKai TC','PingFang SC','PingFang TC','Hiragino Sans','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','Noto Sans CJK SC','Noto Sans JP','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c1714"><div dir="rtl" lang="ar"><p style="margin:0 0 16px">تم للتو تسجيل الدخول إلى حسابك في Lianki من متصفح لم يُستخدم من قبل.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><th scope="row" align="right" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">الوقت</th><td align="right" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">November 9, 2026 at 6:07 PM (Japan Standard Time, GMT+9)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" align="right" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">الموقع التقريبي</th><td align="right" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">Tokyo, Japan</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" align="right" valign="top" class="lk-row lk-muted" style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;color:#5d534a;font-weight:400;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap">المتصفح</th><td align="right" valign="top" class="lk-row" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cc9c42;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word">Safari · iPhone</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px">إذا كنت أنت، فلا داعي لفعل أي شيء.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px">إذا لم تكن أنت، فسجّل الدخول واحذف من صفحة ملفك الشخصي أي مفتاح مرور لا تعرفه، وأخبرنا عبر <a href="https://lianki.com/contact" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">https://lianki.com/contact</a>.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="lk-foot" dir="rtl" align="right" style="padding:14px 28px 22px;border-top:1px solid #cc9c42;font-family:'LXGW WenKai TC','PingFang SC','PingFang TC','Hiragino Sans','Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN','Noto Sans CJK SC','Noto Sans JP','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d534a">إشعارات الأمان مثل هذا مفعّلة لحسابك. يمكنك إيقافها من <a href="https://lianki.com/my/preferences#mail" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">تفضيلاتك</a>، لكننا ننصح بإبقائها.<br><a href="https://lianki.com" style="color:#c8102e;text-decoration:underline">lianki.com</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"`;
